From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] proxy: add AnyTLS outbound with session reuse and UoT

Use the outbound JSON schema proposed in Xray-core PR #5907 and the same
AnyTLS implementation as sing-box at 580984e4d8cb. Adapt Xray's transport
and lifecycle interfaces, preserving TLS, socket marks and dialer chains.
Support TCP and UDP-over-TCP v2 without nesting Xray Mux.Cool. Close the
session pool when the outbound is removed and interrupt pending copies
on cancellation. Include protocol, lifecycle and configuration tests.

Reference: https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/pull/5907
Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

